-- TrinityCore 3.4.3 world DB update
-- Fixes: areatrigger_teleport coordinates using AzerothCore 3.3.5 reference data,
-- confirmed in-game by the dev as producing correct teleports (this project's own
-- values were dropping players inside/under map geometry at these IDs).
--
-- EXCLUDED from this fix (verified NOT bugs, do not revert):
--   ID 5683 'Pit of Saron (Exit)': live sends players to the next Frozen Halls dungeon
--   entrance directly (retail WotLK chained-exit behavior). The AzerothCore
--   value here reverts to open-world Northrend and would be a regression.
--   ID 5688 'Forge of Souls (Exit)': live sends players to the next Frozen Halls dungeon
--   entrance directly (retail WotLK chained-exit behavior). The AzerothCore
--   value here reverts to open-world Northrend and would be a regression.
--
-- FLAG FOR MANUAL VERIFICATION (map ID itself changes, not just coordinates):
--   ID 2890 'Molten Core Entrance, Inside': target_map differs between datasets, not just position.
--   Please confirm this teleport lands correctly after applying.

